; RUN: %solver --SMTLIB2 -s %s 2>&1 | %OutputCheck %s
;
; Forty applications at forty arguments that no arithmetic ever mentions.
; Every such argument used to start at zero and stay there, so the first
; model put all forty at one point and congruence spent a round stating that
; none of them were equal. A model now keeps them apart from the start, and
; there is nothing left for congruence to say.
